mode: build

--- OUT --->
42
--- UNIT_IR --->
# **the same program as line_table.eco, built without `-g`.** every entry point on DebugInfoCodegen is
# a no-op with the flag off, so a call site that forgot to route through one shows up here as metadata
# nobody asked for.
#
# the anchor is the unit header rather than a function, deliberately: without `-g` the per-unit O2
# pipeline runs, `twice` is inlined into its one caller and the symbol is gone. That is the other half
# of what this case says - `-g` implies --no-optimize, and this build is the one that shows what was
# implied
CHECK: [unit main]

CHECK-NOT: !DICompileUnit
CHECK-NOT: !DISubprogram
CHECK-NOT: !DILocation
CHECK-NOT: !DILocalVariable
CHECK-NOT: #dbg_declare
CHECK-NOT: Debug Info Version
CHECK-NOT: Dwarf Version
